WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.013
[♪ opening theme music playing]

2
00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:14.556
[bird screeching]

3
00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:40.666
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

4
00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:44.211
[♪ enchanting music playing]

5
00:00:45.629 --> 00:00:50.759
[Navier] "I will name the bird 'Queen,'
but remember, he is male."

6
00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:52.678
[gasps softly]

7
00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.430
You're a male bird?

8
00:00:55.514 --> 00:00:57.849
[chirping]

9
00:00:57.933 --> 00:00:59.434
[chuckles softly]

10
00:00:59.518 --> 00:01:02.354
-Wonderful.
-[chirping]

11
00:01:12.864 --> 00:01:16.326
I heard that you would eat fish,
yet you haven't touched it.

12
00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:17.953
[chirping]

13
00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:20.497
So perhaps you'd prefer
some sort of insect?

14
00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:21.623
[chirps]

15
00:01:21.707 --> 00:01:23.250
How about we try…

16
00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:26.712
caterpillars or flies?

17
00:01:26.795 --> 00:01:28.005
[chirps]

18
00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:34.761
[chuckles softly]

19
00:01:34.845 --> 00:01:36.096
Thank goodness.

20
00:01:36.179 --> 00:01:37.931
I'm quite afraid of insects.

21
00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:39.683
[chirps happily]

22
00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:40.934
[chuckles softly]

23
00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:47.816
[chirps]

24
00:01:55.157 --> 00:01:57.034
OFFICIAL DOCUMENT OF THE IMPERIAL
HOUSEHOLD MISTRESS CONTRACT

25
00:01:57.701 --> 00:01:58.827
[chirps in alarm]

26
00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:00.996
-[♪ gentle music playing]
-[Navier gasps softly]

27
00:02:01.079 --> 00:02:04.082
[chirping]

28
00:02:04.166 --> 00:02:05.292
Ah!

29
00:02:06.293 --> 00:02:09.588
I heard that a lot of birds
like their feathers patted.

30
00:02:10.255 --> 00:02:11.465
Do you like that, too?

31
00:02:17.179 --> 00:02:18.180
[screeches happily]

32
00:02:18.263 --> 00:02:19.431
[Navier laughs]

33
00:02:20.515 --> 00:02:21.767
[chirping in excitement]

34
00:02:25.312 --> 00:02:27.439
You're adorable. [chuckles]

35
00:02:28.482 --> 00:02:29.775
[chirping]

36
00:02:29.858 --> 00:02:32.194
[♪ serene music playing]

37
00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:12.901
[♪ majestic orchestral music playing]

38
00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:41.179
How can you name a male "Queen"?

39
00:03:41.263 --> 00:03:42.597
What are you talking about?

40
00:03:43.932 --> 00:03:46.226
Weren't you out scouting
like you were supposed to?

41
00:03:46.309 --> 00:03:48.311
Did you wander off somewhere else again?

42
00:03:49.229 --> 00:03:51.440
No. I was out scouting.

43
00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:54.317
[laughing] Scouting…

44
00:03:55.902 --> 00:03:57.612
into another woman's heart again?

45
00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:01.366
No, no, just the Imperial Palace.

46
00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:02.576
You shouldn't say that.

47
00:04:06.496 --> 00:04:07.497
[clicks tongue]

48
00:04:09.374 --> 00:04:10.625
Sire, please,

49
00:04:10.709 --> 00:04:13.253
I really need you to be more careful
with how you act!

50
00:04:15.589 --> 00:04:18.049
You can't ever forget the fact
that you are the first in line

51
00:04:18.133 --> 00:04:19.926
to the throne of the Western Kingdom.

52
00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:28.477
[Navier] "I wish I could be like Queen
and fly the skies.

53
00:04:34.024 --> 00:04:37.110
"I wonder how the world would look
from so high up.

54
00:04:40.071 --> 00:04:43.450
"Even majestic mountains
and the boundless sea

55
00:04:43.533 --> 00:04:45.911
"would seem small from such heights.

56
00:04:48.371 --> 00:04:53.210
"How trivial and insignificant
human worries and sorrows would become

57
00:04:53.293 --> 00:04:55.462
"when you're soaring through the clouds."

58
00:05:02.052 --> 00:05:03.553
OFFICIAL DOCUMENT OF THE IMPERIAL
HOUSEHOLD MISTRESS CONTRACT

59
00:05:06.056 --> 00:05:09.267
EMPRESS NAVIER ELLIE TROVI

60
00:05:32.457 --> 00:05:34.459
[♪ serious music playing]

61
00:05:47.472 --> 00:05:48.598
[door opens]

62
00:05:55.063 --> 00:05:56.398
Her Majesty, sire.

63
00:05:56.481 --> 00:05:59.901
She's signed the contract that approves
Ms. Rashta as your mistress.

64
00:05:59.985 --> 00:06:03.947
EMPEROR SOVIESHU TROVI VICTOR
EMPRESS NAVIER ELLIE TROVI

65
00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:07.617
We'd usually hold a banquet
to celebrate the registration.

66
00:06:07.701 --> 00:06:10.537
However, it coincides
with the New Year's Ceremony.

67
00:06:11.121 --> 00:06:12.539
I'll meet the Empress soon.

68
00:06:12.622 --> 00:06:14.040
I'll talk with her.

69
00:06:15.292 --> 00:06:17.043
-Proceed.
-Yes.

70
00:06:17.127 --> 00:06:20.839
Ah, and what shall we do
about the request from Lady Albani?

71
00:06:25.343 --> 00:06:29.055
Are you saying His Majesty took
the side of his mistress so blatantly?

72
00:06:29.139 --> 00:06:30.557
[noblewoman]
Yes, right in front of Her Majesty

73
00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:32.142
and with all the ladies-in-waiting.

74
00:06:32.225 --> 00:06:35.312
Oh my. That puts the Empress
in a very awkward position.

75
00:06:35.395 --> 00:06:37.689
It wasn't just awkward.
It was humiliating.

76
00:06:37.772 --> 00:06:39.316
[♪ waltz music playing]

77
00:06:39.399 --> 00:06:42.152
You look even more beautiful today,
Your Majesty.

78
00:06:46.948 --> 00:06:48.074
[Sovieshu] I'll do that.

79
00:06:54.414 --> 00:06:56.833
She told me she called you "sister."

80
00:06:58.376 --> 00:07:00.128
It was only later I realized

81
00:07:00.211 --> 00:07:03.340
how disconcerting
that must have been for you.

82
00:07:08.511 --> 00:07:10.096
She only called you that

83
00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:14.184
as she thought I would feel more at ease
if she got along with you like family.

84
00:07:14.267 --> 00:07:15.352
[chuckles softly]

85
00:07:15.977 --> 00:07:17.270
Isn't she innocent?

86
00:07:19.147 --> 00:07:20.357
[sighs softly]

87
00:07:22.734 --> 00:07:23.860
Let us begin.

88
00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:25.278
Yes, Your Majesty.

89
00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:33.953
Lady Albani had demands, I presume?

90
00:07:34.496 --> 00:07:36.998
Did she want recompense
for sponsoring Ms. Rashta?

91
00:07:38.375 --> 00:07:40.418
Nothing is ever free in this world.

92
00:07:41.086 --> 00:07:42.087
Tell me…

93
00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:46.132
Did you grant a pardon
for the Grand Duke, Your Majesty?

94
00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:48.468
Out of the question.

95
00:07:48.551 --> 00:07:52.639
I returned their family crest
and estate in Lucevan, which I had seized.

96
00:07:55.225 --> 00:07:57.936
As for Rashta's banquet,
we shall do as you wish.

97
00:07:58.019 --> 00:07:59.729
Then we shall abstain, Your Majesty.

98
00:08:03.066 --> 00:08:05.235
With so many important guests
in attendance,

99
00:08:05.318 --> 00:08:07.237
the ceremony
will not be eclipsed by scandal.

100
00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:08.905
I agree with you.

101
00:08:08.988 --> 00:08:11.616
It is the grandest festival
of the Imperial Palace,

102
00:08:12.867 --> 00:08:14.202
and also a day for us.

103
00:08:17.372 --> 00:08:19.499
[painter] Please smile, Your Majesties.

104
00:08:24.713 --> 00:08:27.674
"A mistress cannot be entered
into the imperial family register,

105
00:08:27.757 --> 00:08:29.384
"the same for any child born to her."

106
00:08:29.467 --> 00:08:31.970
"They cannot obtain the rights
of imperial royalty."

107
00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:36.015
What does that mean though?

108
00:08:36.099 --> 00:08:38.560
It's saying that if you had any children,

109
00:08:38.643 --> 00:08:41.688
they cannot have the title
"prince" or "princess," I'm afraid.

110
00:08:41.771 --> 00:08:43.314
-Even if the child is royal?
-Yes.

111
00:08:43.398 --> 00:08:46.317
Even if you give birth to a child
who looks identical to the Emperor,

112
00:08:46.401 --> 00:08:49.154
Eastern Empire laws require
the descendants of a mistress

113
00:08:49.237 --> 00:08:50.739
to be managed in a separate genealogy.

114
00:08:50.822 --> 00:08:52.866
You may receive an allowance.

115
00:08:52.949 --> 00:08:54.659
But only whilst you're under contract.

116
00:08:54.743 --> 00:08:56.578
Therefore, once the contract ends,

117
00:08:56.661 --> 00:08:59.414
if it isn't renewed,
you must leave the Imperial Palace.

118
00:09:00.457 --> 00:09:02.459
Are you saying the contract can end?

119
00:09:03.043 --> 00:09:06.463
Typically, the contract is renewed
every two years.

120
00:09:06.546 --> 00:09:08.506
Uh… [clears throat] Here.

121
00:09:14.304 --> 00:09:15.847
[♪ amusing music playing]

122
00:09:18.183 --> 00:09:19.225
[sighs in exasperation]

123
00:09:20.852 --> 00:09:23.104
-Would you excuse us?
-Yes.

124
00:09:28.318 --> 00:09:29.319
Here.

125
00:09:35.241 --> 00:09:36.242
MISTRESS CONTRACT

126
00:09:36.326 --> 00:09:37.577
Now, just here,

127
00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:40.163
beside Her Majesty's signature
is your name.

128
00:09:42.082 --> 00:09:43.625
You cannot… You're…

129
00:09:44.209 --> 00:09:46.294
-You're illiterate.
-[sighs softly]

130
00:09:50.924 --> 00:09:52.133
RASHTA ISHKA BOTULIN

131
00:09:53.384 --> 00:09:54.928
This is how your name is written.

132
00:10:04.479 --> 00:10:05.647
Rashta.

133
00:10:07.816 --> 00:10:10.819
Ish… ka.

134
00:10:12.112 --> 00:10:13.488
Boo…

135
00:10:14.781 --> 00:10:17.075
tuh…

136
00:10:19.369 --> 00:10:21.412
RASHTA ISHKA BOTULIN

137
00:10:21.496 --> 00:10:24.165
…lin.

138
00:10:24.249 --> 00:10:25.875
-[sighs in relief]
-[sighs in relief]

139
00:10:28.086 --> 00:10:29.796
You are all done. [chuckles softly]

140
00:10:29.879 --> 00:10:31.131
I'm sorry…

141
00:10:31.798 --> 00:10:34.509
Can you give Ms. Rashta and I
some time alone, please?

142
00:10:34.592 --> 00:10:37.011
She'll have questions about life
in the Imperial Palace

143
00:10:37.095 --> 00:10:38.638
and may have concerns

144
00:10:38.721 --> 00:10:40.515
that she can only confide
to another woman.

145
00:10:44.644 --> 00:10:47.605
-[door closes]
-This is different from what I hoped.

146
00:10:47.689 --> 00:10:50.859
I heard I won't have a celebratory banquet
due to the New Year's Ceremony.

147
00:10:50.942 --> 00:10:53.319
I thought His Majesty
would at least be here

148
00:10:53.403 --> 00:10:56.197
and celebrate with me
and show his gratitude.

149
00:10:56.281 --> 00:10:59.951
With the New Year's Ceremony so close,
His Majesty is indisposed.

150
00:11:00.034 --> 00:11:01.411
Also, look at the contract.

151
00:11:01.494 --> 00:11:05.206
He can keep me around for two years,
then throw me out once he grows tired.

152
00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:08.835
[gasps] Rashta, now see here!

153
00:11:11.379 --> 00:11:12.672
Don't you understand

154
00:11:12.755 --> 00:11:15.216
that from now,
you're a daughter of Botulin House?

155
00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:18.261
Being thrown out, now that
you're one of us, will never happen.

156
00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:20.305
I say so.

157
00:11:20.388 --> 00:11:22.056
[♪ soft music playing]

158
00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:23.141
[snaps fingers]

159
00:11:24.642 --> 00:11:27.187
These are black diamonds.
Aren't they lovely?

160
00:11:28.855 --> 00:11:32.192
They are only for the women
of Botulin House.

161
00:11:33.276 --> 00:11:34.402
Here.

162
00:11:50.793 --> 00:11:54.547
Congratulations on becoming
His Majesty's woman.

163
00:11:54.631 --> 00:11:56.132
[♪ music swells]

164
00:12:06.434 --> 00:12:10.271
I will set a suitable date for a banquet
in your honor, Ms. Rashta.

165
00:12:11.564 --> 00:12:13.066
Keep your chin tucked in,

166
00:12:13.149 --> 00:12:16.069
lift your chest, keep your back straight,

167
00:12:16.653 --> 00:12:18.488
and your gaze forward.

168
00:12:19.113 --> 00:12:22.533
I will turn you into a noble lady,

169
00:12:22.617 --> 00:12:27.080
who is suited to His Majesty
and his way of life.

170
00:12:29.749 --> 00:12:30.792
[horse whinnies]

171
00:12:32.961 --> 00:12:33.962
[Minister of Finance] 2,000 fireworks,

172
00:12:34.045 --> 00:12:36.256
5,000 packs of cigarettes,

173
00:12:36.339 --> 00:12:39.092
300 casks of whiskey, 400 boxes of caviar,

174
00:12:39.175 --> 00:12:40.927
200 horses and 50 carriages.

175
00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:43.513
As for meat… beef, mutton, and chicken.

176
00:12:43.596 --> 00:12:46.307
And finally, we have 5,000 kegs of beer.

177
00:12:46.391 --> 00:12:47.850
Thank you.

178
00:12:47.934 --> 00:12:50.436
See that it's well prepared
for our subjects to enjoy,

179
00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:51.521
as well as our guests.

180
00:12:51.604 --> 00:12:53.106
Yes.

181
00:12:55.817 --> 00:12:58.861
It is today that Laura's
punishment ends, is it not?

182
00:12:58.945 --> 00:13:00.029
-Yes.
-Yes.

183
00:13:00.655 --> 00:13:03.700
Our other engagement,
the dress fitting, you can postpone it.

184
00:13:04.701 --> 00:13:07.578
I will prepare to fetch Lady Laura.

185
00:13:15.712 --> 00:13:16.921
[birds chirping]

186
00:13:17.005 --> 00:13:18.006
Sister!

187
00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:27.307
Good day, Your Majesty.

188
00:13:29.392 --> 00:13:32.020
I was just on my way to see you, my lady.

189
00:13:32.979 --> 00:13:35.273
I have something to share
with Your Majesty.

190
00:13:35.356 --> 00:13:37.150
My adoptive mother gave me caramels.

191
00:13:37.233 --> 00:13:39.610
They're so delicious
I thought you'd like to try a piece.

192
00:13:47.118 --> 00:13:48.286
Your Majesty…

193
00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:52.123
why do you have
such a scary look on your face?

194
00:13:53.374 --> 00:13:54.792
I do not want you to bring me things.

195
00:13:55.835 --> 00:13:57.253
And also…

196
00:13:58.212 --> 00:13:59.380
refrain from visiting me.

197
00:13:59.964 --> 00:14:03.217
It's not as though we are on such terms
that we enjoy seeing each other.

198
00:14:04.594 --> 00:14:06.637
Then we can try and get on good terms. I…

199
00:14:07.221 --> 00:14:10.641
I'd like to become close friends
with Your Majesty.

200
00:14:12.643 --> 00:14:14.062
There's no need to act this way.

201
00:14:14.145 --> 00:14:15.772
When the next mistress arrives,

202
00:14:16.481 --> 00:14:18.983
you can become close
with her instead of me.

203
00:14:20.902 --> 00:14:22.445
"The next mistress"?

204
00:14:23.071 --> 00:14:24.572
But of course.

205
00:14:24.655 --> 00:14:26.491
There will be others
once he's done with you.

206
00:14:27.075 --> 00:14:28.326
[gasps softly]

207
00:14:28.409 --> 00:14:29.994
If you just wait a little,

208
00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:32.747
you will make plenty of friends.

209
00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:36.334
The previous emperor had eight mistresses.

210
00:14:36.417 --> 00:14:38.419
[♪ moody music playing]

211
00:14:38.503 --> 00:14:42.256
With that many, you can play the ball game
that's popular among the citizen class.

212
00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:44.717
Wouldn't you enjoy that?

213
00:14:46.469 --> 00:14:47.637
[chuckles softly]

214
00:14:53.768 --> 00:14:55.478
[♪ music continues]

215
00:15:10.576 --> 00:15:11.661
[Laura gasps]

216
00:15:12.245 --> 00:15:13.246
Your Majesty!

217
00:15:15.289 --> 00:15:16.582
[Laura grunts]

218
00:15:17.291 --> 00:15:18.668
Your… Your Majesty.

219
00:15:18.751 --> 00:15:20.795
[Laura grunts]

220
00:15:20.878 --> 00:15:22.130
[Laura breathing shakily]

221
00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:27.009
[sobbing softly]

222
00:15:29.428 --> 00:15:31.139
[Verdi] You stayed strong.

223
00:15:31.222 --> 00:15:32.807
You did so well, Laura.

224
00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:34.225
[Laura sobbing]

225
00:15:38.229 --> 00:15:40.064
[Laura] I'll be okay.

226
00:15:40.857 --> 00:15:42.525
[Laura sobbing]

227
00:15:50.324 --> 00:15:51.826
[♪ tense music playing]

228
00:16:20.396 --> 00:16:22.064
I'm here as you requested.

229
00:16:25.151 --> 00:16:26.194
What is it?

230
00:16:26.777 --> 00:16:28.237
Your lady-in-waiting…

231
00:16:29.071 --> 00:16:30.948
the one who was punished…

232
00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:33.159
Daughter of a Marquess.

233
00:16:34.243 --> 00:16:35.995
And her name is Laura Tallital.

234
00:16:40.458 --> 00:16:42.001
I heard you went

235
00:16:42.793 --> 00:16:44.879
-[thuds loudly]
-and took her…

236
00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:47.548
My lady-in-waiting…

237
00:16:48.132 --> 00:16:50.009
suffered for five whole days.

238
00:16:51.469 --> 00:16:53.679
Did you really have to do that?

239
00:16:54.639 --> 00:16:55.890
How does it make me look

240
00:16:55.973 --> 00:16:58.893
if you go out of your way
to care for someone I punished?

241
00:17:01.854 --> 00:17:04.148
Instead of going to the prison
to fetch her…

242
00:17:07.109 --> 00:17:10.905
you should have cast her out
of the Imperial Palace.

243
00:17:10.988 --> 00:17:13.699
She was only punished
for my sake, Your Majesty.

244
00:17:13.783 --> 00:17:15.660
It would not be right
if she were banished.

245
00:17:15.743 --> 00:17:18.412
Besides, her actions made sense.

246
00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:20.581
She merely defended her Empress.

247
00:17:20.665 --> 00:17:22.083
[Sovieshu clicks tongue]

248
00:17:22.166 --> 00:17:23.542
[scoffs]

249
00:17:24.377 --> 00:17:26.963
So you will take her side to the very end?

250
00:17:27.046 --> 00:17:29.715
Those ladies are under my authority.

251
00:17:29.799 --> 00:17:31.592
They should only have to answer to me.

252
00:17:31.676 --> 00:17:34.720
How dare you defend the person
that humiliated Rashta?

253
00:17:35.805 --> 00:17:36.806
[clatters]

254
00:17:38.057 --> 00:17:41.561
And you said such spiteful things
to that poor girl who knows nothing.

255
00:17:41.644 --> 00:17:43.145
Why have you changed so much?

256
00:17:43.813 --> 00:17:44.814
I was spiteful?

257
00:17:44.897 --> 00:17:47.650
I heard you told Rashta
that I would take another mistress.

258
00:17:49.068 --> 00:17:51.445
Historically, the emperor never takes one.

259
00:17:51.529 --> 00:17:53.364
He takes as many as he pleases.

260
00:17:54.031 --> 00:17:55.783
Have you forgotten your promise…

261
00:17:56.867 --> 00:17:59.287
that you would never take one yourself?

262
00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:03.916
You said that you would not embarrass
your empress as the previous was

263
00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:05.835
and let me suffer.

264
00:18:06.752 --> 00:18:09.213
You say Lady Laura humiliated Rashta.

265
00:18:09.297 --> 00:18:13.384
Was it not the same humiliation
to condemn her to prison?

266
00:18:14.635 --> 00:18:16.596
She is my lady-in-waiting.

267
00:18:17.471 --> 00:18:19.682
Your Majesty only chose to punish Laura

268
00:18:19.765 --> 00:18:22.226
to flaunt your command
in front of your mistress.

269
00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:25.563
Anything to please her.

270
00:18:26.063 --> 00:18:29.066
You'll even send the daughter
of a noble house to prison.

271
00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:30.526
It was performative power.

272
00:18:31.068 --> 00:18:33.029
-Enough!
-I'm now laughingstock.

273
00:18:33.738 --> 00:18:35.156
You say I've changed?

274
00:18:36.365 --> 00:18:38.993
Lady Laura has borne the brunt
of your harsh actions…

275
00:18:44.248 --> 00:18:46.417
and it has brought disgrace on her family.

276
00:18:47.752 --> 00:18:49.545
Your Majesty, it isn't me…

277
00:18:51.255 --> 00:18:52.798
but you who's been changed.

278
00:19:01.724 --> 00:19:03.726
[♪ music continues]

279
00:19:10.608 --> 00:19:11.651
[door shuts]

280
00:19:16.947 --> 00:19:18.282
[door opens]

281
00:19:32.254 --> 00:19:33.255
You've returned.

282
00:19:34.298 --> 00:19:35.591
Where's Lady Laura?

283
00:19:35.675 --> 00:19:37.510
We are taking care of her
as you asked, Your Majesty.

284
00:19:38.094 --> 00:19:39.387
So please, do not worry.

285
00:19:40.054 --> 00:19:41.806
In your chamber, there's a gift for you.

286
00:19:41.889 --> 00:19:44.350
It arrived today, from Duchess Trovi.

287
00:19:44.433 --> 00:19:45.476
From Mother?

288
00:20:22.263 --> 00:20:24.265
[♪ gentle music playing]

289
00:20:26.559 --> 00:20:28.394
[Duchess Trovi]
"To Her Majesty the Empress.

290
00:20:28.477 --> 00:20:32.148
"I had very much wished to attend this
New Year's Ceremony and see you.

291
00:20:32.231 --> 00:20:36.152
"However, I decided that I must be patient
for a little longer.

292
00:20:36.235 --> 00:20:38.738
"I found myself recalling
the very first time

293
00:20:38.821 --> 00:20:41.157
"I made clothes for you
before you were born.

294
00:20:41.657 --> 00:20:44.452
"Back then,
even the smallest piece of fabric

295
00:20:44.535 --> 00:20:46.787
"was enough to wrap around you."

296
00:20:46.871 --> 00:20:48.038
Little one…

297
00:20:48.998 --> 00:20:51.459
Your mother will make sure
you look lovely.

298
00:20:52.334 --> 00:20:55.004
"It was true before you came
into this world,

299
00:20:55.087 --> 00:20:56.338
"and remains so now.

300
00:20:56.422 --> 00:20:58.591
"You are my most darling treasure.

301
00:20:59.175 --> 00:21:02.803
"I hope this dress will bring Your Majesty
great comfort and bravery.

302
00:21:03.387 --> 00:21:05.389
"The Duke also sends his regards.

303
00:21:05.473 --> 00:21:09.059
"Whenever he misses you,
he gazes upon the olive tree you planted."

304
00:21:09.143 --> 00:21:10.186
[sighs]

305
00:21:10.269 --> 00:21:12.855
"That tree now casts quite a big shadow.

306
00:21:12.938 --> 00:21:14.148
"My beloved Majesty.

307
00:21:14.231 --> 00:21:15.816
"Please take courage!"

308
00:21:16.358 --> 00:21:20.029
[Kosair] "To my beloved younger sister,
Her Majesty the Empress.

309
00:21:20.112 --> 00:21:22.156
"We fought another small battle today.

310
00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:24.492
"We are clearing out the remnant forces,

311
00:21:24.575 --> 00:21:26.786
"so we may be able
to move up the peace talks.

312
00:21:26.869 --> 00:21:28.704
"If these talks make progress,

313
00:21:28.788 --> 00:21:32.291
"the greatest threat
to the Eastern Empire may disappear.

314
00:21:32.374 --> 00:21:35.878
"Your Majesty, I heard the news
about the Emperor's mistress.

315
00:21:35.961 --> 00:21:41.550
"Our parents were deeply shocked as well,
but they seemed concerned only for you.

316
00:21:41.634 --> 00:21:43.803
"I believe in you, Your Majesty.

317
00:21:43.886 --> 00:21:45.638
"I know how strong you are.

318
00:21:45.721 --> 00:21:46.889
"If only I were near you,

319
00:21:46.972 --> 00:21:50.267
"I would have beaten that rascal
until he was black and blue!

320
00:21:51.018 --> 00:21:54.021
"I will come to see you soon,
Your Majesty.

321
00:21:54.104 --> 00:21:57.107
"Until then, please stay well."

322
00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:16.085
[sniffling]

323
00:22:23.509 --> 00:22:24.760
[sobbing]

324
00:22:37.523 --> 00:22:39.775
[fireworks whistling]

325
00:22:41.068 --> 00:22:42.319
[fireworks bursting]

326
00:22:53.080 --> 00:22:54.248
[McKenna] Oh!

327
00:22:55.040 --> 00:22:56.917
Wow!

328
00:22:57.001 --> 00:22:58.502
Ooh!

329
00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:01.213
[McKenna laughing]

330
00:23:01.964 --> 00:23:03.340
Look there!

331
00:23:14.101 --> 00:23:15.811
[fireworks bursting]

332
00:23:21.901 --> 00:23:23.485
[fireworks continue bursting]

333
00:23:29.617 --> 00:23:30.951
[♪ grand music playing]

334
00:23:32.620 --> 00:23:34.330
[lady-in-waiting] Careful,
don't damage the flowers.

335
00:23:35.331 --> 00:23:36.332
Hurry now!

336
00:24:02.024 --> 00:24:03.984
[♪ music swells]

337
00:24:13.869 --> 00:24:15.120
[horse whinnies]

338
00:24:43.691 --> 00:24:46.443
[mutters softly]
Why would he walk backwards like that?

339
00:24:46.527 --> 00:24:48.779
It's dangerous. [chuckles]

340
00:24:52.366 --> 00:24:53.492
[♪ music fades]

341
00:24:53.575 --> 00:24:56.578
We've allocated 110,000 krang
for the foreign delegation banquet

342
00:24:56.662 --> 00:24:59.289
and 50,000 krang
to enhance the military band

343
00:24:59.373 --> 00:25:00.541
for the commemorative parade.

344
00:25:00.624 --> 00:25:01.959
That sounds perfect.

345
00:25:02.042 --> 00:25:03.544
Thank you for your work.

346
00:25:04.211 --> 00:25:07.840
Your Majesty, we've received a request
for you to welcome a delegation.

347
00:25:08.674 --> 00:25:10.217
It's the Western Kingdom.

348
00:25:10.300 --> 00:25:11.468
The Western Kingdom?

349
00:25:12.594 --> 00:25:14.013
Yes, it's Prince Heinrey.

350
00:25:18.225 --> 00:25:19.977
COMMEMORATING THE 100TH ANNIVERSARY
OF THE FOUNDING

351
00:25:20.060 --> 00:25:21.729
OF THE EMPIRE NEW YEAR'S CEREMONY
ADDITIONAL BUDGET DOCUMENT

352
00:25:24.982 --> 00:25:26.984
[♪ gentle music playing]

353
00:26:56.240 --> 00:26:57.741
[clears throat softly]

354
00:27:04.998 --> 00:27:07.584
It is my honor to meet you,

355
00:27:08.502 --> 00:27:09.753
my queen.

356
00:27:12.798 --> 00:27:16.093
I'm also honored to make
your acquaintance, Prince Heinrey.

357
00:27:24.393 --> 00:27:26.603
You must be tired after your long journey.

358
00:27:27.187 --> 00:27:30.816
You should rest here in the palace
until the New Year's Ceremony begins.

359
00:27:32.109 --> 00:27:34.987
The Eastern Empire's Imperial Palace
is renowned…

360
00:27:35.863 --> 00:27:37.239
for its great beauty.

361
00:27:37.322 --> 00:27:39.116
I'm certain you will like it.

362
00:27:40.868 --> 00:27:41.869
I'm already…

363
00:27:43.662 --> 00:27:44.913
enamored by it.

364
00:27:53.547 --> 00:27:55.674
[♪ bright, playful music playing]

365
00:27:59.428 --> 00:28:02.306
[McKenna] Why are you staring so intently,
Your Highness?

366
00:28:02.389 --> 00:28:04.474
Please avert your gaze.

367
00:28:06.476 --> 00:28:07.603
[McKenna grunts]

368
00:28:11.690 --> 00:28:15.193
[Verdi] I'd like to welcome Princess Circe
of the Southern Kingdom

369
00:28:15.277 --> 00:28:18.447
and Grand Duke Kaufman
of the Kingdom of Luipt.

370
00:28:35.797 --> 00:28:39.217
What has you so preoccupied,
Your Highness?

371
00:28:44.097 --> 00:28:45.098
Whoa!

372
00:28:45.182 --> 00:28:46.850
This… Hmm.

373
00:28:47.476 --> 00:28:49.353
Whoa! [chuckles]

374
00:28:49.436 --> 00:28:50.854
Whoa!

375
00:28:50.938 --> 00:28:52.522
This palace is just…

376
00:28:52.606 --> 00:28:55.025
so huge and lavish!

377
00:28:55.692 --> 00:28:57.027
Wow!

378
00:28:57.110 --> 00:28:59.738
[scoffs] This… this is from that place!

379
00:28:59.821 --> 00:29:03.533
Wow, the Eastern Empire
really is a bunch of thieves

380
00:29:03.617 --> 00:29:06.203
taking the spoils from the war
and putting them on display

381
00:29:06.286 --> 00:29:08.789
-as if they had always belonged to them.
-[♪ bright music playing]

382
00:29:08.872 --> 00:29:10.374
-Isn't that too much?
-[sighs]

383
00:29:10.457 --> 00:29:11.750
Wow!

384
00:29:13.085 --> 00:29:14.211
Don't you think so?

385
00:29:15.337 --> 00:29:16.880
Uh… Your Highness?

386
00:29:19.549 --> 00:29:20.592
Your Highness!

387
00:29:21.468 --> 00:29:23.053
Are you going off somewhere again?

388
00:29:25.222 --> 00:29:27.224
-[Heinrey sighs]
-[birds chirping]

389
00:29:30.227 --> 00:29:31.228
I'll return soon.

390
00:29:31.311 --> 00:29:32.354
[clicks tongue]

391
00:29:32.437 --> 00:29:33.689
Where are you going?

392
00:29:34.731 --> 00:29:36.233
There are too many eyes!

393
00:29:36.316 --> 00:29:38.026
-Your Highness!
-[screeching]

394
00:29:38.110 --> 00:29:39.486
Where are you going?

395
00:29:39.569 --> 00:29:42.322
Where are you… Ugh, seriously?

396
00:29:42.406 --> 00:29:44.157
[noblewomen laughing]

397
00:29:47.077 --> 00:29:48.912
You're coming back
from meeting the delegation

398
00:29:48.996 --> 00:29:50.122
of the Western Kingdom, aren't you?

399
00:29:50.706 --> 00:29:52.082
Please, do tell them.

400
00:29:52.165 --> 00:29:54.126
Is he really as beautiful as they say?

401
00:29:55.502 --> 00:29:57.254
[Laura] I heard one of the maids
in the South Palace

402
00:29:57.337 --> 00:29:59.840
was so overwhelmed by his beauty
that she fainted.

403
00:29:59.923 --> 00:30:01.591
[noblewoman 1] Oh, she fainted?

404
00:30:02.259 --> 00:30:03.301
Oh!

405
00:30:03.385 --> 00:30:04.928
[noblewoman 2] Is he that beautiful?

406
00:30:11.226 --> 00:30:13.061
He was the most beautiful person

407
00:30:15.230 --> 00:30:16.523
that I've ever met.

408
00:30:16.606 --> 00:30:18.191
-[noblewomen gasp]
-[noblewoman 3] Such chiseled features!

409
00:30:18.275 --> 00:30:21.695
His appearance made me question
if he was even human.

410
00:30:21.778 --> 00:30:22.779
[noblewomen gasp]

411
00:30:23.321 --> 00:30:24.781
[noblewoman 4] Did it really?

412
00:30:26.033 --> 00:30:28.493
Uh… what's his voice like?

413
00:30:28.577 --> 00:30:29.578
[noblewoman 5] Yes?

414
00:30:30.245 --> 00:30:31.663
[chirps]

415
00:30:32.706 --> 00:30:34.666
Out of everyone I've spoken to…

416
00:30:36.877 --> 00:30:38.420
his voice was the most lovely.

417
00:30:38.503 --> 00:30:39.796
[all gasp]

418
00:30:40.255 --> 00:30:41.715
-A man like that…
-[chirping]

419
00:30:41.798 --> 00:30:44.426
I'm not at all surprised
that rumors surround him.

420
00:30:45.302 --> 00:30:48.597
Even if he just stands quietly
and keeps to himself.

421
00:30:48.680 --> 00:30:50.515
[noblewoman 6]
Oh, he has a beautiful voice, too?

422
00:30:50.599 --> 00:30:51.600
That's too much!

423
00:30:51.683 --> 00:30:52.851
[indistinct chatter]

424
00:30:53.643 --> 00:30:55.604
[Laura] I think we should be wary
of Prince Heinrey.

425
00:30:55.687 --> 00:30:57.397
He's very dangerous.

426
00:30:57.481 --> 00:30:59.441
I mean, one maid fainted.

427
00:30:59.524 --> 00:31:02.652
And you must have heard
what happened to that other maid.

428
00:31:04.279 --> 00:31:05.280
[chuckles softly]

429
00:31:05.363 --> 00:31:07.157
[♪ enchanting music playing]

430
00:31:07.240 --> 00:31:08.408
-Queen!
-[door closes]

431
00:31:08.492 --> 00:31:10.911
-[chirps]
-[Navier laughing]

432
00:31:10.994 --> 00:31:12.454
[chirping]

433
00:31:19.920 --> 00:31:21.379
If he's responded so quickly,

434
00:31:22.005 --> 00:31:24.674
then surely your master is almost here.

435
00:31:25.675 --> 00:31:26.760
[chirping]

436
00:31:27.677 --> 00:31:31.515
"I have arrived at the Imperial Palace.
Can you guess who I am?"

437
00:31:32.933 --> 00:31:33.934
Wait, he's with you?

438
00:31:34.976 --> 00:31:35.977
[chirps]

439
00:31:47.072 --> 00:31:48.865
Where's your master?

440
00:31:48.949 --> 00:31:50.075
Is he among those guests?

441
00:31:50.158 --> 00:31:51.993
[chirping]

442
00:31:57.541 --> 00:31:59.543
I do not know who you are.

443
00:32:00.460 --> 00:32:03.463
But tell me, do you know who I am?

444
00:32:04.256 --> 00:32:05.257
[♪ music fades]

445
00:32:05.340 --> 00:32:07.134
[thunder rumbling]

446
00:32:09.511 --> 00:32:11.138
[thunder roaring]

447
00:32:13.515 --> 00:32:15.517
-[Marquess Lante] Come on, hurry up.
-[maid] Yes, sir.

448
00:32:16.101 --> 00:32:17.102
[Marquess Lante] Yes, over there.

449
00:32:17.185 --> 00:32:18.478
[thunder rumbling]

450
00:32:19.646 --> 00:32:21.523
[Eliza] Please, it is so very late.

451
00:32:22.107 --> 00:32:23.650
Go to bed, Your Majesty.

452
00:32:24.818 --> 00:32:27.028
I hope the rain ceases before the morning.

453
00:32:29.072 --> 00:32:30.073
Come now.

454
00:32:31.449 --> 00:32:34.411
You are the one who must shine
the brightest in this palace,

455
00:32:34.494 --> 00:32:35.912
so you cannot stay up late.

456
00:32:37.914 --> 00:32:39.040
[Navier sighs]

457
00:32:42.711 --> 00:32:44.838
Is the South Palace comfortable
for the guests?

458
00:32:44.921 --> 00:32:46.715
They are all in high spirits

459
00:32:46.798 --> 00:32:49.467
and seem to have no intention
of calling it a night.

460
00:32:49.551 --> 00:32:51.469
They're still drinking, my lady.

461
00:32:51.553 --> 00:32:53.638
-They are?
-What I've heard

462
00:32:53.722 --> 00:32:57.601
is the ladies are pining
so ardently over Prince Heinrey.

463
00:32:57.684 --> 00:32:59.686
They say they have formed ranks.

464
00:32:59.769 --> 00:33:01.396
Those who have exchanged words,

465
00:33:01.479 --> 00:33:03.106
those who have made eye contact,

466
00:33:03.190 --> 00:33:04.691
and those he has smiled at.

467
00:33:05.775 --> 00:33:09.070
I think what the ladies
really want to know is

468
00:33:09.154 --> 00:33:11.031
who the prince will dance with first.

469
00:33:12.532 --> 00:33:14.409
So which lady do you think is most likely?

470
00:33:15.202 --> 00:33:18.872
There are talks of Duchess Tuania,
others say Princess Circe.

471
00:33:18.955 --> 00:33:20.498
There are divided opinions.

472
00:33:20.582 --> 00:33:23.210
Although I'm sure
they're all thinking the same thing.

473
00:33:23.293 --> 00:33:26.338
They all wish he'll walk over to them,

474
00:33:26.421 --> 00:33:28.381
take their hand and dance the night away.

475
00:33:28.465 --> 00:33:29.716
[gasps] What a dream!

476
00:33:29.799 --> 00:33:31.676
[Navier laughing]

477
00:33:31.760 --> 00:33:33.345
[Eliza laughing]

478
00:33:33.428 --> 00:33:35.013
Good night, Your Majesty.

479
00:33:41.561 --> 00:33:42.979
[thunder cracking]

480
00:33:43.063 --> 00:33:44.189
[thuds]

481
00:33:48.193 --> 00:33:49.861
Oh, my goodness!

482
00:33:51.446 --> 00:33:53.031
[chirps]

483
00:33:57.494 --> 00:33:58.620
[chirps]

484
00:33:58.703 --> 00:34:00.455
[♪ gentle music playing]

485
00:34:01.957 --> 00:34:03.166
Oh, good heavens!

486
00:34:04.209 --> 00:34:05.293
It's raining so hard.

487
00:34:05.377 --> 00:34:07.545
Did your master really make you fly here?

488
00:34:09.172 --> 00:34:10.257
[sighs]

489
00:34:13.260 --> 00:34:15.553
How long have you been waiting?

490
00:34:16.137 --> 00:34:17.180
Are you all right?

491
00:34:19.516 --> 00:34:21.059
[chirps]

492
00:34:21.685 --> 00:34:22.894
[sighs]

493
00:34:27.482 --> 00:34:31.611
[Heinrey] "Shall we make a bet?
Whoever finds the other first wins!"

494
00:34:48.670 --> 00:34:51.840
[Navier] "If it is a bet,
what will you wager?"

495
00:34:56.136 --> 00:34:57.679
[thunder rumbling]

496
00:34:57.762 --> 00:34:58.930
[thunder cracks]

497
00:35:00.015 --> 00:35:01.308
[gasps]

498
00:35:01.391 --> 00:35:02.851
[chirps]

499
00:35:04.227 --> 00:35:05.520
I cannot do this.

500
00:35:06.146 --> 00:35:08.148
I'm not sending you outside
in this weather.

501
00:35:10.817 --> 00:35:12.110
Why don't you stay here tonight?

502
00:35:12.193 --> 00:35:13.862
[chirping]

503
00:35:13.945 --> 00:35:17.198
You will return to your master
when it stops raining.

504
00:35:17.282 --> 00:35:18.366
[chirps]

505
00:35:37.636 --> 00:35:40.013
I find myself wondering
what your master's like.

506
00:35:42.515 --> 00:35:44.392
Is he sweet and clever, like you?

507
00:35:49.397 --> 00:35:51.858
Come to think of it, Prince Heinrey…

508
00:35:52.442 --> 00:35:54.653
He has eyes as purple as yours.

509
00:35:54.736 --> 00:35:57.280
I'm already enamored by it.

510
00:35:59.908 --> 00:36:02.827
[cooing]

511
00:36:03.620 --> 00:36:05.664
You are so pretty, Queen.

512
00:36:10.001 --> 00:36:11.002
Good night.

513
00:36:22.722 --> 00:36:25.058
[rain pattering]

514
00:36:39.781 --> 00:36:43.868
-[♪ music continues]
-[birds chirping]

515
00:37:48.975 --> 00:37:50.143
[Albani] Begin.

516
00:37:50.226 --> 00:37:53.104
[♪ amusing music playing]

517
00:37:53.688 --> 00:37:54.773
Good!

518
00:37:54.856 --> 00:37:56.858
Very good so far.

519
00:37:56.941 --> 00:37:58.985
Slowly. That's it.

520
00:37:59.068 --> 00:38:00.445
Keep your balance.

521
00:38:01.029 --> 00:38:02.405
Oh!

522
00:38:02.489 --> 00:38:03.615
Very good.

523
00:38:03.698 --> 00:38:05.450
Now we'll try without the book.

524
00:38:05.533 --> 00:38:07.327
There. Bup-bup-bup-bup-bup.

525
00:38:07.410 --> 00:38:08.912
You need to walk slower.

526
00:38:11.623 --> 00:38:12.707
Like this?

527
00:38:12.791 --> 00:38:14.751
That's right.

528
00:38:14.834 --> 00:38:17.879
You should always be mindful
of the maids' strides

529
00:38:17.962 --> 00:38:19.881
following behind you.

530
00:38:19.964 --> 00:38:23.051
Slowly, so the maids can follow…

531
00:38:23.134 --> 00:38:24.219
What are you doing?

532
00:38:24.302 --> 00:38:26.262
No, don't match your stride to theirs.

533
00:38:26.346 --> 00:38:27.430
If you aren't quick enough,

534
00:38:27.514 --> 00:38:29.015
then those lowly creatures
will step on your dress.

535
00:38:29.098 --> 00:38:31.768
[groans] Then how exactly should I walk?

536
00:38:31.851 --> 00:38:33.561
They should match what I do.

537
00:38:33.645 --> 00:38:34.896
You should walk in a way

538
00:38:34.979 --> 00:38:37.440
that never lets those following you
relax at all.

539
00:38:37.524 --> 00:38:40.568
That way, they never forget
that you are their mistress.

540
00:38:40.652 --> 00:38:42.737
[sighs in exasperation] This is hard!

541
00:38:42.821 --> 00:38:44.447
Well, yes, it should be hard.

542
00:38:44.531 --> 00:38:46.074
How are the writing lessons?

543
00:38:47.325 --> 00:38:49.911
Reading is a little easier,

544
00:38:49.994 --> 00:38:51.538
-the writing is…
-Hmm.

545
00:38:51.621 --> 00:38:54.290
Well then, it looks like
you will continue your lessons

546
00:38:54.374 --> 00:38:56.042
during the New Year's Ceremony.

547
00:38:56.668 --> 00:38:58.419
I'll be tired
after all the parties I'll attend.

548
00:38:58.503 --> 00:38:59.796
[scoffs] Listen.

549
00:38:59.879 --> 00:39:01.464
Relax your eyebrows. Shoulders straight.

550
00:39:01.548 --> 00:39:02.966
Chest up, too.

551
00:39:03.049 --> 00:39:04.092
Chin.

552
00:39:04.175 --> 00:39:05.635
Corners of your mouth.

553
00:39:06.344 --> 00:39:09.013
Next. Yes, your gaze.

554
00:39:09.639 --> 00:39:11.099
Mmm.

555
00:39:11.182 --> 00:39:12.433
Well done.

556
00:39:13.101 --> 00:39:14.310
Beautiful!

557
00:39:22.026 --> 00:39:24.779
[♪ grand music playing]

558
00:39:29.117 --> 00:39:32.287
Now, ladies, a busy day of preparation
is ahead. Understood?

559
00:39:32.996 --> 00:39:35.957
Of course. We've begun
the preparations already, Countess.

560
00:39:37.709 --> 00:39:39.043
-Ta-da!
-Ta-da!

561
00:39:39.127 --> 00:39:40.169
[both giggle]

562
00:39:48.511 --> 00:39:50.513
[♪ music swells]

563
00:40:33.473 --> 00:40:34.724
Countess?

564
00:40:34.807 --> 00:40:37.727
Do you think Rashta
will also be at the ceremony?

565
00:40:37.810 --> 00:40:39.729
I suppose she will attend.

566
00:40:39.812 --> 00:40:41.397
As the girl is now…

567
00:40:41.481 --> 00:40:43.691
-a daughter of the Botulin House.
-[Marquess Lante clears throat]

568
00:40:43.775 --> 00:40:47.153
[courtier] His Majesty the Emperor
and Her Majesty the Empress.

569
00:40:47.236 --> 00:40:49.948
[♪ fanfare playing]

570
00:40:57.830 --> 00:40:59.666
[crowd clapping]

571
00:40:59.749 --> 00:41:01.960
[♪ captivating music playing]

572
00:41:44.002 --> 00:41:47.755
As you know, I played a part
in the war of a Hundred Years.

573
00:41:48.339 --> 00:41:50.341
I loyally followed my predecessor.

574
00:41:50.425 --> 00:41:53.052
It was so cold that even
the strongest liquor froze.

575
00:41:54.971 --> 00:41:56.889
The horses turned to ice in death.

576
00:41:56.973 --> 00:41:57.974
The frost…

577
00:41:58.683 --> 00:42:01.269
rendered the bread impossible to chew.

578
00:42:01.352 --> 00:42:03.771
The cold armor
clung to our skin so tightly

579
00:42:03.855 --> 00:42:05.648
that we could not even prize it off.

580
00:42:05.732 --> 00:42:08.651
[Navier] The cold armor
clung to our skin so tightly

581
00:42:08.735 --> 00:42:10.820
that we could not even prize it off,

582
00:42:11.487 --> 00:42:16.284
and only the hot blood of our enemies
could melt away the biting cold.

583
00:42:17.702 --> 00:42:19.704
[Sovieshu] And only the hot blood
of our enemies

584
00:42:19.787 --> 00:42:21.789
could melt away the biting cold.

585
00:42:23.791 --> 00:42:25.293
When the Hundred Years' War ended,

586
00:42:26.169 --> 00:42:27.420
peace fell upon us all.

587
00:42:28.004 --> 00:42:29.338
And yet,

588
00:42:29.422 --> 00:42:32.884
our swords and our shields,
they have not rusted at all.

589
00:42:32.967 --> 00:42:34.302
This peace eternal

590
00:42:34.385 --> 00:42:38.389
can only be protected by readied armor
and a blade that shines.

591
00:42:39.182 --> 00:42:41.809
A blade that is ready to be drawn
at any moment.

592
00:42:41.893 --> 00:42:43.019
And I…

593
00:42:43.102 --> 00:42:44.937
will preserve and defend our empire.

594
00:42:45.021 --> 00:42:48.816
and we shall see that
this strength and peace lasts

595
00:42:48.900 --> 00:42:50.943
for 10,000 years.

596
00:42:52.528 --> 00:42:54.447
[♪ music crescendos]

597
00:42:56.324 --> 00:42:58.326
I share this glory with you.

598
00:43:12.632 --> 00:43:13.633
Join me!

599
00:43:13.716 --> 00:43:16.260
[all] Long live His Majesty the Emperor!

600
00:43:16.344 --> 00:43:17.386
The Emperor!

601
00:43:17.470 --> 00:43:21.307
Long live Her Majesty the Empress!
The Empress!

602
00:43:23.601 --> 00:43:25.728
-[♪ band playing waltz music]
-[guests chatter]

603
00:43:34.487 --> 00:43:37.073
It has been a long time, Lady Albani.

604
00:43:37.156 --> 00:43:38.825
-[Sirim] Lady Albani!
-Good to see you.

605
00:43:38.908 --> 00:43:40.827
-Nice to meet you.
-[Albani chuckles softly]

606
00:43:41.410 --> 00:43:42.453
[chuckles softly]

607
00:44:00.972 --> 00:44:02.014
[Sovieshu exhales]

608
00:44:03.933 --> 00:44:06.060
I was hoping I could dance
with Rashta first.

609
00:44:07.854 --> 00:44:10.314
After all, our only rehearsal
was to this piece.

610
00:44:12.775 --> 00:44:14.443
I'll see you later.

611
00:44:15.153 --> 00:44:16.362
[exhales] Your Majesty.

612
00:44:35.923 --> 00:44:37.133
[guests gasp]

613
00:44:37.216 --> 00:44:38.509
[guests murmuring]

614
00:44:40.803 --> 00:44:42.555
[gasps] What do we do?

615
00:44:50.688 --> 00:44:53.232
[♪ waltz music playing]

616
00:45:08.414 --> 00:45:10.541
She seems to be following
what she was taught well.

617
00:45:10.625 --> 00:45:12.543
What a clever little thing.

618
00:45:28.893 --> 00:45:29.894
Majesty.

619
00:45:29.977 --> 00:45:31.020
[Laura gasps]

620
00:45:32.980 --> 00:45:34.023
[exhales]

621
00:45:37.276 --> 00:45:39.195
[♪ music continues]

622
00:46:01.175 --> 00:46:02.885
[guests murmuring]

623
00:46:15.606 --> 00:46:16.899
[Sovieshu grunts in pain]

624
00:46:16.983 --> 00:46:19.527
-[♪ music stops]
-[Sovieshu groans]

625
00:46:24.740 --> 00:46:25.741
[exhales]

626
00:46:26.325 --> 00:46:27.326
It's all right.

627
00:46:28.244 --> 00:46:29.787
Like this.

628
00:46:30.538 --> 00:46:31.831
[Rashta] Mmm.

629
00:46:32.999 --> 00:46:34.542
[♪ music resumes]

630
00:46:38.713 --> 00:46:40.006
[both laughing]

631
00:47:01.777 --> 00:47:02.778
McKenna.

632
00:47:04.280 --> 00:47:05.448
What's with the flower?

633
00:47:09.076 --> 00:47:11.662
There are many eyes watching here.

634
00:47:15.624 --> 00:47:16.625
[noblewoman giggling]

635
00:47:23.132 --> 00:47:25.468
[♪ enthralling music playing]

636
00:48:24.819 --> 00:48:26.695
[♪ music continues]

637
00:48:27.780 --> 00:48:29.615
-[all gasping]
-My goodness!

638
00:48:29.698 --> 00:48:30.950
[gasps]

639
00:48:31.033 --> 00:48:32.118
[gasps softly]

640
00:48:32.201 --> 00:48:33.744
For the Empress?

641
00:48:44.755 --> 00:48:47.508
Are you a good dancer, Your Majesty?

642
00:48:54.140 --> 00:48:55.933
[♪ music swells]

643
00:48:59.145 --> 00:49:01.397
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

644
00:49:03.482 --> 00:49:05.484
[♪ closing theme music playing]

